dmin Panel** (`http://localhost:5173/admin`) to replace the cluttered list view with a **clean, modern SaaS database layout** and a **spacious Two-Column Studio Editor & Inspector**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎨 What Was Fixed & Redesigned:\\n\\n### 1. 📋 Clean SaaS Database Row Layout (Fixed Screenshot Issue):\\n- **Removed Cluttered Screaming Red All-Caps Subtitles**:\\n  - Previously, the entire description was appearing in bright red uppercase text above the title.\\n  - Now, the **Title** is crisp and prominent (e.g. `Performance Ads`), with an elegant category icon/image box, a subtle single-line preview description in muted gray, deliverables pill tag (`4 Deliverables`), and live green status indicator (`🟢 Live`).\\n- **Clean Action Bar**:\\n  - Subtle `Edit & SEO` button + trash action on each row.\\n  - Top header displays collection count pill and \\\"+ Add Service / Role / Article\\\" button.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. 🖥️ Two-Column Modern Studio Editor & Inspector Modal:\\n- **Left Pane (Content & Markdown Workspace - 65% width)**:\\n  - High-craft Title, Category, and Summary inputs.\\n  - **Visual Markdown Toolbar** (`H2`, `H3`, `Bold`, `Italic`, `Bullet Lists`, `Quotes`, 💡 `Key Takeaways`, `Links`).\\n  - **Live Preview Toggle** to view the formatted typography.\\n  - Real-time **Word Count**, **Character Count**, and **Estimated Reading Time**.\\n- **Right Pane (Inspector Sidebar - 35% width)**:\\n  - **SEO & Google SERP Inspector**: Live character counters for Meta Title (0/60) & Meta Description (0/160) + Live Google Search Snippet Box.\\n  - **Image Media Library**: Direct URL input + 1-click select from curated agency stock presets.\\n  - **AI Growth Copywriting**: 1-click generate high-converting outlines, auto-extract meta tags, and commercial keywords.\\n\"","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with clean Admin UI redesign details\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009c