{"step_index":387,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:06:42Z","content":"Aapke screenshot me jo **cluttered aur red all-caps text** dikh raha tha, use pura **clean, modern SaaS Database Table** aur **Two-Column Professional Studio Editor** me redesign kar diya gaya hai! 🎨✨\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ Kya Changes Kiye Gaye Hain:\n\n#### 1. 📋 Clean SaaS List Rows (Screenshot Issue Fixed):\n- **Screaming Red All-Caps Text Removed**:\n  - Pehle title ke upar pura description red all-caps me aa raha tha jo kaafi loud aur kharab lag raha tha.\n  - Ab har row me **Bold Clean Title** (`Performance Ads`, `Website Design & Web Experiences`), subtle muted 1-line description, colored icon box ya thumbnail image, deliverables count tag (`4 Deliverables`), aur green live status badge (`🟢 Live`) display hota hai.\n- Rows ab clean, structured aur modern SaaS design (jaise Stripe/Webflow/Notion) me render hoti hain.\n\n#### 2. 🖥️ Two-Column Professional Studio Editor:\nJab aap **\"Edit & SEO\"** ya **\"+ Add\"** par click karenge:\n- **Left Column (Content Workspace - 65%)**:\n  - Clean Title, Subtitle, aur Deliverables inputs.\n  - **Visual Markdown Toolbar** (`H2`, `H3`, `Bold`, `Italic`, `Bullet Lists`, `Numbered Lists`, `Quotes`, 💡 `Key Takeaways`).\n  - **Raw / Live Preview Toggle** aur **Word Counter & Reading Time**.\n- **Right Column (Inspector Sidebar - 35%)**:\n  - **SEO & Google Search SERP Preview**: Live character counters (`0/60` Title, `0/160` Description) aur live Google snippet box.\n  - **Image Media Library**: Direct URL paste karein ya 1-click curated agency stock presets select karein.\n  - **AI Copy Assistant**: 1-click outline generator aur keyword extractor.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Abhi Live Check Karein:\n\n👉 **[http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin)**\n- **Secret Key**: `dev-admin-token`\n\nAap [http://localhost:5173/admin](http://localhost:5173/admin) open karke naya clean list view aur split-screen editor