Tool / Lead capture calculator, ROI estimators, case study metrics (+300% growth, #1 rankings).\\n5. Navigation and layout structure.\\n\\nProvide a clear, comprehensive breakdown of all these key elements so we can build an industry-leading, best-in-India digital marketing agency frontend and real-time backend CMS inspired by Techmagnate.\",\"Role\":\"Techmagnate Website Researcher\",\"TypeName\":\"research\"}]","toolAction":"\"Researching techmagnate.com\"","toolSummary":"\"Browse and analyze techmagnate.com\""}}]}
