{"step_index":430,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:40:34Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough documenting the transformation of Get Into Feed into an enterprise digital marketing agency inspired by Techmagnate.com with full 2-way real-time backend CMS sync.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Techmagnate-Inspired Enterprise Digital Marketing Agency & Real-Time Studio CMS\\n\\nWe have overhauled **Get Into Feed** into India's premier **Enterprise Digital Marketing & Performance Agency platform**, inspired by the industry-benchmark architecture of **Techmagnate.com**, with instantaneous 2-way backend synchronization.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🏛️ What Was Built (Techmagnate Enterprise Architecture):\\n\\n### 1. 📢 Top Announcement IP Banner\\n- Highlights proprietary intellectual property: *\\\"Explore our 2026 Digital Report Card: Driving +273% AI & Search Visibility Growth across 100+ Brands.\\\"* with 1-click download link.\\n\\n### 2. 🧭 Enterprise Mega-Menu Header & Strategy Hotline\\n- **Growth Hotline**: `+91-98765-43210` • `growth@getintofeed.com`\\n- **Nationwide Presence**: *Bengaluru • Mumbai • Delhi-NCR • Pune*\\n- **Interactive Services Mega Dropdown**:\\n  - *Column 1*: Enterprise & AI SEO (GEO), Local Map Pack Dominance\\n  - *Column 2*: Google Search & PMax, Meta & Instagram Ads Scaling\\n  - *Column 3*: Sub-Second React Web & CRO, BI Analytics & GA4 MarTech\\n  - *Column 4*: Annual Report Highlight Card\\n- Primary CTA: `Claim Free 360° Audit →`\\n\\n### 3. ⚡ Enterprise Hero with Live 60-Second Instant Audit Tool\\n- **Headline**: *\\\"Delivering Transformational Growth Through AI-Powered SEO & Performance Marketing\\\"*\\n- **Instant Website Audit Tool**:\\n  - Visitors can type their Website URL + Contact -> Select Focus area -> Click **\\\"Get Free Audit\\\"** -> Lead is instantly ingested into the backend CMS!\\n- **Trust Badges**:\\n  - `Google Premier Partner (Top 3%)`\\n  - `Meta Certified Partner`\\n  - `Clutch 4.9 / 5.0 (120+ Reviews)`\\n  - `₹250+ Cr Client Revenue Generated`\\n\\n### 4. 🏢 Client Marquee & Verticals Matrix\\n- Marquee Brands: *Airtel, Bajaj Finserv, Apollo Hospitals, Veloura Organics, Mahindra, Reliance, Hero Fincorp, FinScale*.\\n- Interactive Industry Selector: *E-Commerce & D2C, BFSI & Fintech, Healthcare, B2B SaaS, EdTech, Real Estate*.\\n\\n### 5. 🛠️ 360° Integra\n<truncated 1995 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with complete Techmagnate enterprise frontend documentation\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ashis\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b658bbd2-2aad-47d2-8dee-60fbb78009cc\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Document Techmagnate enterprise frontend upgrade\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
